# PART 1 — WORLDLEO BUSINESS MODEL

## 1.1 Business vision

WorldLeo is one professionally managed marketplace connecting customers with independent service providers.

Initial service regions:

- Greater Toronto Area.
- Hamilton and surrounding communities.
- Niagara Region.
- Other Ontario locations only when actual provider coverage exists.

WorldLeo has two principal service divisions.

### WORLDLEO HOME

Home repairs, renovations, property maintenance, improvement projects, professional trades and AI-assisted renovation planning.

### WORLDLEO AUTO

Automotive repairs, mobile mechanics, tire services, battery assistance, vehicle maintenance and roadside support.

Within WorldLeo Auto, **FixSoon** is the rapid roadside-assistance feature.

Within WorldLeo Home, **AI Design Studio** is the AI-assisted renovation visualization and planning feature.

Both divisions must share the same core marketplace infrastructure.

## 1.2 Marketplace operating model

WorldLeo operates as a **managed marketplace with evidence-based service monitoring**.

The model includes:

- Independent providers performing contracted services.
- WorldLeo coordinating service requests.
- Provider matching based on actual qualifications and availability.
- Transparent quotations.
- Customer approval before additional charges.
- Secure payment processing.
- Administrative service-progress monitoring.
- Provider completion-evidence submissions.
- WorldLeo completion reviews.
- Structured dispute resolution.
- Transparent provider commissions.
- Approved payment-provider payouts.

WorldLeo should not automatically be presented as the construction contractor, automotive repair business, employer of all providers, or guarantor of all workmanship.

Provider responsibilities, WorldLeo responsibilities and customer rights must be clearly distinguished.

