- Payment-processing fees.
- Provider allocations.
- Payment events.
- Refunds.
- Disputes.
- Chargebacks.
- Payout reconciliation.
- Financial audit logs.

### Security rules

Never store raw card information.

Verify payment-provider webhooks.

Use idempotency keys and duplicate-event protection.

Do not assume payment succeeded merely because a customer reached a success page.

Keep service completion, customer payment and provider payout statuses separate.

Do not initiate real charges, real transfers or real payouts without explicit approval.

### Renovation payments

