- Approved scope.
- Milestone definitions.
- Amount due.
- Evidence.
- Change orders.
- Customer communication.
- Payment status.
- Statutory holdback treatment where applicable.

Do not treat ordinary platform quality reviews as a substitute for statutory construction-payment requirements.

